title: macOS DYLD_INSERT_LIBRARIES Injection
id: 98b136bc-f7aa-4131-99fb-39eb50f1fb73
status: experimental
description: Detects use of the DYLD_INSERT_LIBRARIES environment variable to load an attacker dylib into a process at launch on macOS, a library-injection technique for code execution and hooking.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1574/006/
logsource:
  product: macos
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    CommandLine|contains: 'DYLD_INSERT_LIBRARIES'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - User
falsepositives:
  - Some developer and debugging tools
level: high
tags:
  - attack.privilege_escalation
  - attack.t1574.006
